TTS** | Clone voice from 3-15s reference audio |\n  | **LongCat AudioDiT Multi-Speaker TTS** | Multi-speaker dialogue with [speaker_N]: tags |\n\n  ---\n\n  ## Parameters\n\n  | Parameter | Default | Description |\n  |-----------|---------|-------------|\n  | steps | 16 | ODE Euler solver steps (4-64) |\n  | guidance_strength | 4.0 | CFG/APG guidance scale (0-10) |\n  | guidance_method | cfg / apg | cfg for TTS, apg for voice cloning |\n  | dtype | auto | auto, bf16, fp16, fp32 |\n  | attention | auto | auto, sdpa, sage_attention, flash_attention |\n  | keep_model_loaded | true | Cache model + auto-offload to CPU between runs |\n\n  ---\n\n  ## Voice Cloning\n\n  Connect reference audio (3-15 seconds recommended) to `prompt_audio` input. Providing `prompt_text` (transcript) improves quality significantly.\n\n  ---\n\n  ## Multi-Speaker\n\n  Use `[speaker_N]:` tags in text:\n  [speaker_1]: Hello, welcome to the show!\n  [speaker_2]: Thanks for having me!\n  [speaker_1]: Let's get started.\n\n  ---\n\n  ## Links\n\n  - Original [LongCat-AudioDiT](https://github.com/meituan-longcat/LongCat-AudioDiT)\n  - Models [3.5B](https://huggingface.co/meituan-longcat/LongCat-AudioDiT-3.5B) / [3.5B-bf16](https://huggingface.co/drbaph/LongCat-AudioDiT-3.5B-bf16) / [3.5B-fp8](https://huggingface.co/drbaph/LongCat-AudioDiT-3.5B-fp8)\n  - Issues [Report Bug](https://github.com/Saganaki22/ComfyUI-LongCat-AudioDIT-TTS/issues)"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "rgba(24,24,27,.9)", "size": [523.61962890625, 1080.1800537109375], "pos": [-4883.04931640625, 7562.0234375], "id": 417, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 0}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "audio", "links": [868], "label": "audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "audio"}], "size": [419.203125, 504.90625], "pos": [-3884.73486328125, 7615.859375], "widgets_values": ["LongCat-AudioDiT-3.5B-bf16", "你能听到的跑酷声音在凌晨三点。你能看到的掉毛发生在无时无刻。你能品味的猫砂每天给你管够。喵窖二零二六。", "你能听到的历史一百四十六年，你